  "full_text": "I am Roman Catholic, and the religion for my kingdom would be Roman Catholic, but the church is dead. And as any good Catholic boy knows, church is not the building, it's the people. And it's sick, like King Herod was the servant that was ill. The Romans begged Jesus to cure their sick servant. Right now, the computer industry is sick like Herod. The Roman church is sick like Herod. The world is sick like Herod. And I'm going to cure it. This is the one thing that distinguishes class is appreciation for richness and creation of richness. And the kings want to impress each other or share with each other or compete with each other on the richness of their kingdom. Anyway, so a boy was their richness and beauty in the church here. Anyway, so Jesus himself gave the... He's the king of kings. He said, you don't put... New wine and old wineskins, okay? So God said the best religion is the one with the most new vistas of understanding over a lifetime. And so to get this church going, it's going to be based on personal communication with God, like I've been trying to spread. God is for you. Who can be against you? The Bible says in one place... No one will teach God because everyone will know me. So there's a prophecy of everybody talking to God. So that's the foundation for the new church based on Temple OS. I've already established how to practice this new church, and it will grow, hopefully, with the richness. I'm a Roman Catholic, but the church is dead, and this is the way forward. Okay, so I'm the king of this kingdom and this is what I'm doing.",
